have to be recovered manually.","nextNodeIds":[718210104]},{"nodeId":718210104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":4212047322,"text":"Sure, they are quite a view, floating majestically in the air, but at the same time, they can also be quite a nuisance.","nextNodeIds":[718210105]},{"nodeId":718210105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":1885652970,"text":"If its lampshade is poorly made, a lantern will break mid-air, leaving only a chunk of Plaustrite that flies all over the place.","nextNodeIds":[718210106]},{"nodeId":718210106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":986061746,"text":"Some Xiao Lanterns also get blown away by the wind and end up stuck in random nooks...","nextNodeIds":[718210107]},{"nodeId":718210107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":1542793714,"text":"The former creates safety concerns, while the latter litters the city landscape. So the Ministry of Civil Affairs usually delegates the responsibility of recovering Xiao Lanterns to a specific person.","nextNodeIds":[718210108]},{"nodeId":718210108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":4083679482,"text":"As it happens, it's my turn this year...","nextNodeIds":[718210109]},{"nodeId":718210109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":3236814210,"text":"But the amount of Xiao Lanterns released during the festival is overwhelming... If I were to retrieve them all the day after the celebrations end, I'd be done for.","nextNodeIds":[718210110]},{"nodeId":718210110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":4137988386,"text":"So the only feasible way is to remove the broken and misplaced lanterns gradually, as people release them.","nextNodeIds":[718210111]},{"nodeId":718210111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":2622771914,"text":"Even so, I doubt I can collect them all on my own.","nextNodeIds":[718210112]},{"nodeId":718210112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":2697122706,"text":"Traveler, would you mind checking a few spots for Xiao Lanterns that need to be recovered?","nextNodeIds":[718210113]},{"nodeId":718210113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":2402,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3837788610,"text":"Leave it to me.","nextNodeIds":[718210114]},{"nodeId":718210114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2064,"speakerName":"Hongyu","textMapHash":959699770,"text":"I've marked the locations on the map for you. Thanks for your help!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7182101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["2064"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7182111,"order":3,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":461687420,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7182109"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QU